# WHAT NOBODY CAN LIST HAS NO REFERRER, AND NEEDS NONE. `helper` looks the name `run` up on a value that nobody knows, and `caller`, the one function that calls it, lies under that name in an object that unseen code has.
# With a node for each name `helper` led to `caller` and `caller` to `helper`: one cycle, in which nothing is ordered, so `helper` took nothing of what its one caller leaves. In a large program nearly every function stood in that cycle.
# An edge is there for the unit that a mention may bring. All that is made of the body of `caller` is in the queue from the start, so whoever finds it under its name brings nothing.
# function helper(y) { return y.run; }  function caller(x) { return helper(x); }  sink({ run: caller });
# RUN: link functions mechanisms=all
# CHECK: function f1 {{*}} in-queue-from-start
# CHECK: referrers f0
# CHECK: function f2 callers-known one-callee {{*}} takes-arrivals
# CHECK: referrers f1
# CHECK-NOT: group
# RUN(COUNTS): link counts mechanisms=all
# COUNTS: counts callers first | every caller known and every call with one callee 1 | of those take arrivals 1 | in the queue from the start 1 | reached functions in the largest cycle 1

layout L0 module=m0 fields=[{key="run" declared={type=anything} flags=[IsRequired]}]
module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
function f0 module=m0 kind=Module thisType={type=anything} results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v1 = PropGet v0 key="sink" [isFreeName]
    v2 = NewClosure function=f1
    v3 = NewObject -, v2 layout=L0 fields=[0]
    v4 = FinishObject v3
    v5 = Call v1, -, v4
    Return v5
}
function f1 name="caller" module=m0 length=1 thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything):
    v1 = NewClosure function=f2
    v2 = Call v1, -, v0 calleeName="helper" [isNeverInlined]
    Return v2
}
function f2 name="helper" module=m0 length=1 thisType={type=anything} parameters=[{type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything):
    v1 = PropGet v0 key="run"
    Return v1
}
